{"data": [{"author_id": "842092929040711681", "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:34:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110106910099952003"], "id": "2110106910099952003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Request to @KPTrafficDept Please upload Parking point in Google maps, if it is possible! So its very easy to find Parking point through Google Map. Thank You For Maintaining Busy traffic with very Smoothly in huge Crowd in Durga Pujo! \nHappy Durga Pujo \ud83d\ude4f", "url": "https://x.com/SoumenB8013/status/2110106910099952003"}, {"author_id": "1695103118831407104", "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110101265636282832"], "id": "2110101265636282832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "\ud83d\udea8 BREAKING: Kolkata is gearing up for Durga Puja 2026! With over 400 additional puja celebrations reported, police are strengthening security and crowd management across the city. \ud83e\udd41\ud83d\ude4f #WestBengal #Kolkata #DurgaPuja2026", "url": "https://x.com/suddha123basak/status/2110101265636282832"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110095858767384576"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T19:50:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110095867340566831"], "id": "2110095867340566831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u0985\u09ad\u09bf\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u0995\u09c7\u09b0\u09be \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be \u09aa\u09c1\u09b2\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b0 \u0986\u0993\u09a4\u09be\u09a7\u09c0\u09a8 \u09b8\u09ae\u09b8\u09cd\u09a4 \u09a5\u09be\u09a8\u09be \u0993 \u099f\u09cd\u09b0\u09be\u09ab\u09bf\u0995 \u0997\u09be\u09b0\u09cd\u09a1, \u09b9\u09be\u0993\u09a1\u09bc\u09be \u0993 \u09b6